mprofile-kernel
Target Report Mask(PROFILE_KERNEL)
Call mcount for profiling before a function prologue

;  Select pointer size. This flag only used for CellOS Lv-2
;  Enable 64bit features, but address and pointer is handles in 32bit
;  space. This flag is asserted by -mp32 or -mlp32 option
mlp32
Target Report RejectNegative Mask(PPC64_LP32)
Generate codes in ILP32 model.(defualt)

;
mlp64
Target Report RejectNegative InverseMask(PPC64_LP32, PPC64_LP64)
Generate codes in LP64 model.

mp32
Target Report RejectNegative Mask(PPC64_LP32) MaskExists
same as -mlp32 option

mprxfixup
Target Report RejectNegative
Invoke ppu-lv2-prx-fixup after linking. This is default.

mno-prxfixup
Target Report RejectNegative
Does not invoke ppu-lv2-prx-fixup after linking. Special option for toolchain developer.

mprx
Target Report RejectNegative
Link objects in PRX mode.

mprx-with-runtime
Target Report RejectNegative
Link objects in PRX mode with the PRX runtime.

mlv2-stub
Target Report RejectNegative
Link with the lv2_stub.a library (even when using -mno-prxfixup)

msn-ld
Target Rerpot
Invoke SN linker instead of GNU binutils LD. This is default.

mforce-prx-fixup
Target Rerpot RejectNegative
Invoke ppu-lv2-fixup instead of oneramp linking built in SN LD. This is for debug perpose.

; Bz50260
mppuguid
Target Report
Embed PPU GUID after linking.

; Bz51659
;  - Supress NOP to restore TOC
mno-nop-after-bl
Target Report RejectNegative Undocumented Var(lv2_no_nop_after_bl) Init (0)
Does not generate nop after bl. This option should be used only for a single TOC executable.

; Bz51659
;  - Supress STD/LD to save/restore R2 (TOC base)
mno-save-restore-tocbase
Target Report RejectNegative Undocumented Var(lv2_no_save_restore_tocbase) Init (0)
Does not save/restore TOC base. This option should be used only for a single TOC executable.

; Bz51659
;  - Enable the following options:
;      -mno-nop-after-bl
;      -mno-save-restore-tocbase
;      -falign-functions=1
;      -falign-jumps=1
;      -falign-labels=1
;      -falign-loops=1
mcellos-kernel
Target Report RejectNegative Undocumented
For Cell OS kernel

; Bz50853
;  - Link libcs
mfast-libc
Target Report RejectNegative
Link with libcs.a instead of libc.a from the point of view of performance.

; Bz57983
mcallprof=
Target Var(lv2_callprof) Init(0) Joined UInteger
Generate programs that are available for CallProf of SN Tuner.
-mcallprof=0 has no effect (default).
-mcallprof=1 enables function profiling by Tuner.
-mcallprof=2 enables callgraph profiling. (It will be available at SDK300 or later).

